	},
	"book of ava": {
		"description": "Power Push: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Melee range.\nOn a success, they're knocked back to Far range and take d10+2 magic damage using your Proficiency.\nTava's Armor: Spend a Hope to give a target you can touch a +1 bonus to their Armor Score until their next rest or you cast Tava's Armor again.\nIce Spike: Make a Spellcast Roll (12) to summon a large ice spike within Far range. If you use it as a weapon, make the Spellcast Roll against the target's Difficulty instead. On a success, deal d6 physical damage using your Proficiency.",
